{"seq":2,"slug":"map-ndcg","title":"MAP 与 NDCG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/map-ndcg","wordCount":1329,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"map-与-ndcg\">MAP 与 NDCG</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MAP（Mean Average Precision）和 NDCG（Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain）是信息检索中衡量排序质量的两个核心指标。与精确率和召回率关注「返回了什么」不同，MAP 和 NDCG 关注的是「排序对不对」——相关文档是否被排在了高位。这对现代搜索系统至关重要，因为用户从上到下浏览结果，排在前面的结果获得更多注意力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[排序结果列表] --&gt; B{评估维度}&#10;    B --&gt; C[MAP]&#10;    B --&gt; D[NDCG]&#10;    C --&gt; E[二元相关性]&#10;    C --&gt; F[每个相关文档位置的精确率均值]&#10;    D --&gt; G[分级相关性]&#10;    D --&gt; H[位置折损 + 增益累积]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;AP = Σ P@k × rel(k) / |Rel|&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&quot;DCG = Σ (2^rel - 1) / log₂(k+1)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[排序结果列表] --&gt; B{评估维度}\n    B --&gt; C[MAP]\n    B --&gt; D[NDCG]\n    C --&gt; E[二元相关性]\n    C --&gt; F[每个相关文档位置的精确率均值]\n    D --&gt; G[分级相关性]\n    D --&gt; H[位置折损 + 增益累积]\n    E --&gt; I[\"AP = Σ P@k × rel(k) / |Rel|\"]\n    G --&gt; J[\"DCG = Σ (2^rel - 1) / log₂(k+1)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>相关性类型</th>\n<th>位置敏感</th>\n<th>归一化</th>\n<th>主要应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AP</td>\n<td>二元</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>除以 Rel 数量</td>\n<td>TREC Ad-hoc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAP</td>\n<td>二元</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>跨查询平均</td>\n<td>学术 IR 评测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCG</td>\n<td>分级</td>\n<td>是（对数折损）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>原始累积增益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDCG</td>\n<td>分级</td>\n<td>是（对数折损）</td>\n<td>除以理想 DCG</td>\n<td>工业搜索系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MRR</td>\n<td>二元</td>\n<td>仅首个相关</td>\n<td>跨查询平均</td>\n<td>QA、导航检索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"average-precision-与-map\">Average Precision 与 MAP</h2><p>Average Precision（AP）是单个查询的排序质量指标。对于排序结果列表中的每个位置 k，如果该位置的文档是相关的，就计算在该位置的精确率 P@k 并纳入平均。最终 AP 等于所有相关文档位置的 P@k 之和除以相关文档总数 |Rel|。</p>\n<p>AP 的直觉是：如果所有相关文档都排在结果的最前面，AP = 1.0；如果相关文档散布在列表各处，AP 会因为非相关文档的插入而下降。AP 自然地给予排在高位的相关文档更多权重。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RankedResult {&#10;  readonly docId: string;&#10;  readonly rank: number;&#10;  readonly relevance: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeAveragePrecision(rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;, relevant: ReadonlySet&lt;string&gt;): number {&#10;  let relevantSoFar = 0;&#10;  let sumPrecision = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; rankedDocs.length; i++) {&#10;    if (relevant.has(rankedDocs[i])) {&#10;      relevantSoFar++;&#10;      sumPrecision += relevantSoFar / (i + 1);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return relevant.size &gt; 0 ? sumPrecision / relevant.size : 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeMAP(&#10;  queries: ReadonlyArray&lt;{&#10;    queryId: string;&#10;    rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;    relevant: ReadonlySet&lt;string&gt;;&#10;  }&gt;,&#10;): number {&#10;  if (queries.length === 0) return 0;&#10;&#10;  let totalAP = 0;&#10;  for (const query of queries) {&#10;    totalAP += computeAveragePrecision(query.rankedDocs, query.relevant);&#10;  }&#10;  return totalAP / queries.length;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RankedResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> docId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> relevance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeAveragePrecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rankedDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">relevant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlySet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevantSoFar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sumPrecision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rankedDocs.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (relevant.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rankedDocs[i])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      relevantSoFar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sumPrecision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevantSoFar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevant.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sumPrecision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevant.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeMAP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    queryId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rankedDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    relevant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlySet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalAP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queries) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalAP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeAveragePrecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query.rankedDocs, query.relevant);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalAP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MAP（Mean Average Precision）是 AP 在多个查询上的平均值。MAP 是 TREC 评测中最常用的主指标，它综合了精确率、召回率和排序位置三个维度的信息，被认为是二元相关性下最全面的单一评估指标。</p>\n<p>MAP 的一个重要性质是它等价于 PR 曲线下面积（AUC-PR）的离散近似。因此 MAP 越高，PR 曲线越靠近右上角，系统在所有召回率水平上的精确率表现都越好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dcg-与-ndcg\">DCG 与 NDCG</h2><p>DCG（Discounted Cumulative Gain）引入了两个关键创新：支持分级相关性（不仅是相关/不相关的二元判断）和对数位置折损（排在后面的文档增益被折扣）。</p>\n<p>DCG 的标准公式为 <code>DCG@k = Σ_{i=1}^{k} (2^rel_i - 1) / log_2(i + 1)</code>。分子 <code>2^rel_i - 1</code> 将相关性等级映射为增益值（rel=0 → 0, rel=1 → 1, rel=2 → 3, rel=3 → 7），使高相关文档的增益指数增长。分母 <code>log_2(i+1)</code> 实现位置折损，排位越靠后折损越大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GradedRelevance {&#10;  readonly docId: string;&#10;  readonly relevanceLevel: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeDCG(rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;GradedRelevance&gt;, cutoff: number): number {&#10;  let dcg = 0;&#10;  const k = Math.min(cutoff, rankedDocs.length);&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; k; i++) {&#10;    const gain = Math.pow(2, rankedDocs[i].relevanceLevel) - 1;&#10;    const discount = Math.log2(i + 2);&#10;    dcg += gain / discount;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dcg;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeIDCG(relevanceLevels: ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;, cutoff: number): number {&#10;  const sorted = [...relevanceLevels].sort((a, b) =&gt; b - a);&#10;  const idealDocs = sorted.slice(0, cutoff).map((rel, i) =&gt; ({&#10;    docId: `ideal_${i}`,&#10;    relevanceLevel: rel,&#10;  }));&#10;  return computeDCG(idealDocs, cutoff);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeNDCG(&#10;  rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;GradedRelevance&gt;,&#10;  allRelevanceLevels: ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;,&#10;  cutoff: number,&#10;): number {&#10;  const dcg = computeDCG(rankedDocs, cutoff);&#10;  const idcg = computeIDCG(allRelevanceLevels, cutoff);&#10;  return idcg &gt; 0 ? dcg / idcg : 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface NDCGEvaluation {&#10;  readonly queryId: string;&#10;  readonly ndcgAt5: number;&#10;  readonly ndcgAt10: number;&#10;  readonly ndcgAt20: number;&#10;  readonly dcgAt10: number;&#10;  readonly idcgAt10: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function evaluateQuery(&#10;  queryId: string,&#10;  rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;GradedRelevance&gt;,&#10;  allRelevanceLevels: ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;,&#10;): NDCGEvaluation {&#10;  return {&#10;    queryId,&#10;    ndcgAt5: computeNDCG(rankedDocs, allRelevanceLevels, 5),&#10;    ndcgAt10: computeNDCG(rankedDocs, allRelevanceLevels, 10),&#10;    ndcgAt20: computeNDCG(rankedDocs, allRelevanceLevels, 20),&#10;    dcgAt10: computeDCG(rankedDocs, 10),&#10;    idcgAt10: computeIDCG(allRelevanceLevels, 10),&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GradedRelevance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> docId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> relevanceLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeDCG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rankedDocs</span><