E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rankedDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GradedRelevance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  allRelevanceLevels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NDCGEvaluation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queryId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ndcgAt5: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeNDCG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rankedDocs, allRelevanceLevels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ndcgAt10: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeNDCG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rankedDocs, allRelevanceLevels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ndcgAt20: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeNDCG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rankedDocs, allRelevanceLevels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dcgAt10: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeDCG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rankedDocs, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    idcgAt10: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeIDCG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(allRelevanceLevels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>NDCG（Normalized DCG）通过除以理想排序的 DCG（IDCG）将 DCG 归一化到 [0, 1] 范围。IDCG 是将所有文档按相关性从高到低排列时的 DCG 值，代表完美排序的效果上限。NDCG = 1.0 意味着系统的排序与理想排序完全一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ndcg-的工程实践\">NDCG 的工程实践</h2><p>NDCG@k 是工业搜索系统中最常用的评估指标，k 的选择取决于产品形态：Web 搜索通常用 NDCG@10（一页结果），移动搜索用 NDCG@5（屏幕有限），商品搜索可能用 NDCG@20（用户会翻页浏览）。</p>\n<p>在线评估中，NDCG 需要与点击模型结合。由于在线场景无法获得全面的人工相关性判定，通常使用点击数据作为隐式反馈：被点击的文档赋予较高的相关性分数，展示但未点击的赋予较低分数，未展示的文档不参与计算。这种基于点击的 NDCG 存在位置偏差（高位文档更容易被点击），需要通过 IPW（Inverse Propensity Weighting）等方法校正。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估场景</th>\n<th>推荐指标</th>\n<th>k 值</th>\n<th>相关性来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TREC Ad-hoc</td>\n<td>MAP</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>人工标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web 搜索</td>\n<td>NDCG@10</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>人工 + 点击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动搜索</td>\n<td>NDCG@5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>人工 + 点击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商搜索</td>\n<td>NDCG@20</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>购买 + 点击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QA 系统</td>\n<td>MRR</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>人工标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐系统</td>\n<td>NDCG@K</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>隐式反馈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mrr-与其他排序指标\">MRR 与其他排序指标</h2><p>MRR（Mean Reciprocal Rank）适用于只关心第一个正确答案的场景，如导航型查询和问答系统。RR（Reciprocal Rank）等于第一个相关文档排位的倒数：如果第一个相关文档排在第 3 位，RR = 1/3。MRR 是多个查询的 RR 均值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function computeReciprocalRank(rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;, relevant: ReadonlySet&lt;string&gt;): number {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; rankedDocs.length; i++) {&#10;    if (relevant.has(rankedDocs[i])) {&#10;      return 1 / (i + 1);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeMRR(&#10;  queries: ReadonlyArray&lt;{&#10;    rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;    relevant: ReadonlySet&lt;string&gt;;&#10;  }&gt;,&#10;): number {&#10;  if (queries.length === 0) return 0;&#10;  let totalRR = 0;&#10;  for (const q of queries) {&#10;    totalRR += computeReciprocalRank(q.rankedDocs, q.relevant);&#10;  }&#10;  return totalRR / queries.length;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeReciprocalRank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rankedDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">relevant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlySet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rankedDocs.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (relevant.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rankedDocs[i])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeMRR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rankedDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    relevant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlySet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalRR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queries) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalRR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeReciprocalRank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q.rankedDocs, q.relevant);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalRR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ERR（Expected Reciprocal Rank）是 NDCG 的概率模型替代，它模拟用户从上到下浏览结果并在某个位置停止的行为。ERR 考虑了文档之间的依赖关系：如果排在前面的文档已经满足了用户需求，后续文档即使相关，其贡献也会被折扣。这比 NDCG 假设文档独立评估更接近真实用户行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AP 衡量单个查询的排序质量，MAP 是 AP 在多查询上的平均</li>\n<li>MAP 等价于 PR 曲线下面积，是二元相关性下最全面的评估指标</li>\n<li>DCG 引入分级相关性和对数位置折损，NDCG 通过除以 IDCG 归一化到 [0, 1]</li>\n<li>NDCG@k 是工业搜索系统最常用的评估指标，k 取决于产品形态</li>\n<li>在线评估中基于点击的 NDCG 需要 IPW 校正位置偏差</li>\n<li>MRR 适用于只关心首个正确答案的场景</li>\n<li>不同指标适用于不同检索场景，选择时需考虑相关性类型和用户行为模型</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MAP 与 NDCG","id":"map-与-ndcg"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Average Precision 与 MAP","id":"average-precision-与-map"},{"level":2,"text":"DCG 与 NDCG","id":"dcg-与-ndcg"},{"level":2,"text":"NDCG 的工程实践","id":"ndcg-的工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"MRR 与其他排序指标","id":"mrr-与其他排序指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"精确率与召回率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/precision-recall"},"next":{"title":"评估方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/evaluation-methodology"}}